        {
          "index": 1,
          "type": "input",
          "title": "You'll want to know: منذ",
          "segments": [
            {
              "kind": "speech",
              "text": "منذ — mundhu — \"since, ago\"."
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "index": 2,
          "type": "etymology",
          "title": "The word, taken apart",
          "segments": [
            {
              "kind": "speech",
              "text": "منذ (mundhu) is an old particle of time. Lane reports that some call it a simple word and others a compound, and its origin is not settled; it is not built on a three-letter root."
            }
          ]
        },
        {
